<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA SCORE 302-4 V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA SCORE 302-4 V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka made 302 for four  from their 50 overs in the one-day match against India at Colombo's R. Premadasa stadium on Sunday.</p>
</text>
